  "body": "All agents buyers welcome, contact Jayden for conjunctional.\r\n\r\nExperience brand-new, high-spec living in a superb coastal setting just moments from Eastern Beach. Thoughtfully designed for modern family life, this impressive home combines quality finishes, generous spaces, beautiful sea views and effortless indoor-outdoor living in one of East Auckland's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nOffering four spacious bedrooms, each with its own ensuite, the home provides exceptional comfort and privacy. Three bedrooms are positioned downstairs, while the luxurious master suite occupies the upper level and enjoys direct access to its own private balcony. Two separate living areas provide flexibility for families, with one on each level.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the stunning high-stud open-plan kitchen, dining and living area upstairs, where expansive windows and the elevated position capture beautiful sea views and create a wonderful space for entertaining and everyday family living. The upstairs living area opens to its own balcony, allowing you to enjoy the coastal outlook, and is complemented by both a heat pump and fireplace, creating a warm and inviting space to enjoy throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the living area and all three bedrooms open seamlessly to the deck and beautifully landscaped, easy-care yard, creating an ideal setting for relaxed indoor-outdoor living. The double internal-access garage and additional off-street parking provide excellent practicality for families and guests.\r\n\r\nWith Eastern Beach just a stone's throw away, beautiful sea views and highly regarded schools nearby, this is an outstanding opportunity to secure a brand-new coastal home in a premium family-friendly location. The property is zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n\r\nA sophisticated new home, beautiful sea views, exceptional coastal location and excellent school zoning - this is Eastern Beach living at its best.",
